{"objects":[{"subject":"winter_wyvern_eldwurms_edda","mechanisms":[]},{"subject":"winter_wyvern_winters_curse","mechanisms":[{"mechanism":"ground_zone","condition":"base","quote":"寒冬飞龙驱散一个敌方目标并将其冻在原地，附近的其他敌人将受到癫狂诅咒，对冻住的队友进行攻击，而且攻击速度得到提升。冻住的目标和被诅咒攻击队友的敌人不会受到任何来自敌方的伤害，不过寒冬飞龙或她控制的单位造成的伤害除外。敌方英雄进入施放后的诅咒范围内会增加诅咒的持续时间。","uncertain":false}]},{"subject":"arc_warden_flux","mechanisms":[]},{"subject":"arc_warden_magnetic_field","mechanisms":[{"mechanism":"ground_zone","condition":"base","quote":"天穹守望者制造一个充满磁能的圆形扭曲力场。磁场提供攻击速度加成，并且其中的友方单位可以闪避来自磁场外的攻击。","uncertain":false}]},{"subject":"arc_warden_spark_wraith","mechanisms":[]},{"subject":"arc_warden_runic_infusion","mechanisms":[]},{"subject":"arc_warden_tempest_double","mechanisms":[]},{"subject":"abyssal_underlord_firestorm","mechanisms":[{"mechanism":"ground_zone","condition":"base","quote":"召唤数波火焰风暴攻击目标区域内的所有单位，并额外持续造成烧灼伤害。","uncertain":false}]},{"subject":"abyssal_underlord_pit_of_malice","mechanisms":[{"mechanism":"ground_zone","condition":"base","quote":"在目标区域制造致命的深渊；踏入深渊的敌方单位将受到伤害并且被缠绕。每个敌方单位每隔%pit_interval%秒才会再次受到作用。","uncertain":false}]},{"subject":"abyssal_underlord_atrophy_aura","mechanisms":[]},{"subject":"abyssal_underlord_raid_boss","mechanisms":[]},{"subject":"abyssal_underlord_dark_portal","mechanisms":[{"mechanism":"ground_zone","condition":"scepter","quote":"在传送门两端各召唤一个怨念深渊。","uncertain":false}]},{"subject":"monkey_king_boundless_strike","mechanisms":[]},{"subject":"monkey_king_tree_dance","mechanisms":[]},{"subject":"monkey_king_jingu_mastery","mechanisms":[]},{"subject":"monkey_king_mischief","mechanisms":[]},{"subject":"monkey_king_wukongs_command","mechanisms":[{"mechanism":"ground_zone","condition":"base","quote":"齐天大圣变出圆形的猴子猴孙阵列，猴子猴孙从他的位置散开。若齐天大圣离开范围，猴子猴孙将会消失。猴子猴孙继承齐天大圣的攻击力，攻击频率为固定的%attack_speed%秒，并且只会以敌方英雄为目标。","uncertain":false}]},{"subject":"monkey_king_transfiguration","mechanisms":[]},{"subject":"pangolier_swashbuckle","mechanisms":[]},{"subject":"pangolier_shield_crash","mechanisms":[]},{"subject":"pangolier_lucky_shot","mechanisms":[{"mechanism":"attack_modifier","condition":"base","quote":"石鳞剑士的攻击或技能拥有一定几率大幅降低攻击速度，同时削弱护甲。","uncertain":false}]},{"subject":"pangolier_rollup","mechanisms":[]},{"subject":"pangolier_gyroshell","mechanisms":[]},{"subject":"pangolier_fortune_favors_the_bold","mechanisms":[]},{"subject":"dark_willow_bramble_maze","mechanisms":[{"mechanism":"ground_zone","condition":"base","quote":"%initial_creation_delay%秒后邪影芳灵在目标区域创造出%placement_range%范围的迷宫，迷宫拥有%placement_count%棵荆棘。进入荆棘的敌人将被缠绕，并且持续受到伤害。迷宫持续%placement_duration%秒。","uncertain":false}]}]}